    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages predation probability functions for species across different instars. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class computes the probability of predation events using multiple components, including predator reach, voracity, prey traits, and probability density functions (PDFs). It also manages instar-specific maximum PDF values and sensory model integration. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
